WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Got a mod idea? Tell it to the raven.
Meet Hugin's Vibes.

00:04.000 --> 00:08.000
Set up once: connect an AI provider, install the Build Pak,
and prepare your local game libraries.

00:08.000 --> 00:12.000
Create a Vibe. Tell Hugin what to change.
Your code has its own local Git history.

00:12.000 --> 00:16.000
Watch tool calls and compiler feedback.
Ask for fixes and keep iterating.

00:16.000 --> 00:20.000
Package the plugin, manifest, README and icon.
Game reference DLLs stay out of the ZIP.

00:20.000 --> 00:24.000
Publish to your own Hugin's Vibes catalogue.
Your worlds can now select the mod.

00:24.000 --> 00:28.000
Select the mod on a test world. Update the world.
Sync your client. Join, try, and tweak.

00:28.000 --> 00:32.000
Let Hugin cook. PhValheim 2.59.
Open Tools, then Hugin's Vibes.
